ssues/6935#issuecomment-860012726","id":860012726,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/6935","minimized":null,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDg2MDAxMjcyNg==","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/860012726/reactions"},"updated_at":"2021-06-12T07:11:55Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/860012726","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11729078?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jekbradbury/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jekbradbury/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jekbradbury/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jekbradbury/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jekbradbury","id":11729078,"login":"jekbradbury","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzI5MDc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jekbradbury/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jekbradbury/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jekbradbury/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jekbradbury/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jekbradbury/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jekbradbury","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"NONE","body":"We will test with the version mentioned in in #6942. Much of our development is using TPU VMs, but the code for this project relies on kubernetes support and as such we need Cloud TPUs until we can figure something out.\r\n\r\nIs there a list of tpu_driver releases? I haven't been able to find much documentation on released versions / changes.","created_at":"2021-06-14T16:24:23Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/6935#issuecomment-86081773