_via_github_app":null,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/events/4887435196"},{"actor":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20912915?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mganahl/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mganahl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mganahl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mganahl/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mganahl","id":20912915,"login":"mganahl","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTEyOTE1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mganahl/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mganahl/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mganahl/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mganahl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mganahl/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mganahl","user_view_type":"public"},"author_association":"NONE","body":"Here is a minimal example that demonstrates the OOM issues we are seeing. \r\n\r\n``` python \r\nfrom cloud_tpu_client import Client                                                  \r\nimport jax\r\nimport numpy as np\r\n\r\ntpu_name = 'fill me in'   # name of the tpu in the 2VM setup\r\nc = Client(tpu_name)                                                                           \r\nc.configure_tpu_version('tpu_driver0.1-dev20210603') # code below crashes with OOM error with this driver\r\n# c.configure_tpu_version('tpu_driver0.1-dev20200911') #code below works with this drivers\r\ntpu_address = \"fill me in\" #network endpoint in the 2VM setup\r\njax.config.update(\"jax_backend_target\", 'grpc://' + tpu_address)\r\njax.config.update(\"jax_xla_backend\", 'tpu_driver')\r\n\r\n@jax.partial(jax.pmap, static_broadcasted_argnums = (1,2))\r\ndef random_contract(gate, nsteps, N):\r\n    np.random.seed(0)\r\n    shape = (2,)*(N-13) + (8,128)\r\n    state = jnp.ones(shape)\r\n    for n in range(nsteps):\r\n       # pick random axes to contract\r\n        axes = tuple(np.random.choice(np.arange(len(shape) - 2), size=7, replace=False))\r\n        other = tuple(sorted(set(range(len(shape))) - set(axes)))\r\n        perm = axes + other\r\n        new_shape = (128,) + (2,) * (len(shape) - 2 - 7) + (8,128)\r\n\r\n       # move contracted axes to the front of the array\r\n        state = state.transpose(perm).reshape(new_shape)\r\n\r\n       # contract and reshape\r\n        state = jnp.tensordot(gate, state, (1,0))\r\n        state = state.reshape(shape)\r\n    return state\r\n\r\n# this may or may not crash depending on the driver\r\nfinal_state = random_contract(np.random.rand(8,128,128), 100,32) \r\n```\r\nI'm wondering if the OOM errors are related to the compilation. The compilation times here are quite substantial (around 15 min).","created_at":"2021-06-15T09:13:00Z","event":"commented","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/6935#issuecomment-861331699","id":861331699,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/6935","minimized":null,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDg2MTMzMTY5OQ==","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/861331699/reactions"},"updated_at":"2021-06-15T09:13:33Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/861331699","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20912915?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mganahl/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mganahl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mganahl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mganahl/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mganahl","id":20912915,"login":"mganahl","node_id"